<title>USA: International CompuTex names CFO.</title>
<headline>International CompuTex names CFO.</headline>
<dateline>ATLANTA 1997-07-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>International CompuTex Inc said Wednesday it named Ralph Walter chief financial officer and chief accounting officer.</p>
<p>He replaces Emil Dahan, the company's chief executive, as CFO and board member Patricia Tuxbury Salem as chief accounting officer.</p>
<p>Walter joined the company in March 1997 as controller.</p>
